[background arg="res://assets/backgrounds/BlackBaground.png" fade="1.0" wait="true"]
Shateroo, Lake.
[wait time="1.0"]
if {CharaMeeting.meet_vlad} == false:
	Narrator: Near the lake, a thin young weird man sits alone on a bench, flinching every time someone walks too close.
	[background arg="res://assets/backgrounds/lake_side_placeholder.jpg" fade="0.0"]
	audio BGS "res://assets/audio/sfx/Lake - sound.wav" [volume="-30.0" loop="true"]
	audio music "res://assets/audio/music/Town_road_bgm.wav"
	join Vlad (Vlad_happy) center
	catherine: Um, hello. Sorry to bother you. Mind if I sit?
	Vlad (Vlad_confused): *Flinches*...Oh. Um. N-no, not really, I am Vlad. But who are you? I've never seen you around town.
	catherine: My name is Catherine. I am a newcomer here, and I am looking for something. I don’t know if you can help me.
	set {CharaMeeting.meet_vlad} = true
else:
	Narrator: Near the lake, Vlad sits alone on a bench.
	[background arg="res://assets/backgrounds/lake_side_placeholder.jpg" fade="0.0"]
	audio BGS "res://assets/audio/sfx/Lake - sound.wav" [volume="-30.0" loop="true"]
	audio music "res://assets/audio/music/Town_road_bgm.wav"
	join Vlad (Vlad_happy) center
	Vlad: I … I didn't know if you'd come. I got a chair if you want to talk for a bit.
- Ask about the monsters
	catherine: Have you seen the monster who lives by the lake? Sharp dressed, doesn't blink much. The tales about him are unsettling.
	Vlad: Stay away from him. He's not cruel, exactly, but he's not safe either. Not for a human, alone.
	leave Vlad
	set {EndingTracking.catherine_sympathy} -= 1.0
	set {ChapterTracking.is_evil} = true
- Ask about the creature
	catherine: Have you seen the creature who lives by the lake? Sharp-dressed, doesn't blink much.
	Vlad: He's... actually not so bad, from what I've seen. Keeps to himself, minds his business. I don't think he'd hurt you.
	leave Vlad
	set {EndingTracking.catherine_sympathy} += 1.0
	set {ChapterTracking.is_evil} = false
audio music - [loop="true"]
[background arg="res://assets/backgrounds/lake_side_placeholder.jpg" fade="0.0"]
jump day_02_monster/